flowchart TD
    P1[POWER ON\nLED 2 flashes]
    P2[HARDWARE INIT\nGPIO, SPI, I2C, ADC]
    P3[EEPROM INIT\nCounters, DevNonce, has_joined_once, CRC check]
    P4[RTC INIT\nRead time, flag if year less than 2026]
    P5[EPD INIT\nVariant A: Ready if first boot else Connecting]
    P6[LORA INIT\nSX1262, credentials]
    P7{has_joined_once?}
    P8[EPD Ready\nWait for staff 0+1+2 hold 3s to trigger join]
    P9[LORA JOIN\nOTAA 10 attempts; disconnected + 1hr rejoin if fail]
    P10[RTC SYNC\nDeviceTimeReq if connected]
    P11[EPD UPDATE\nLast Cleaned plus timestamp if Variant A]
    P12[BOOT UPLINK\nEvent 0x04; if rejoin then counter sync Event 0x07]
    P13[NORMAL MODE\nButtons, heartbeat, rejoin timer if disconnected]

    P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5 --> P6 --> P7
    P7 -->|First boot| P8
    P7 -->|Subsequent boot| P9 --> P10 --> P11 --> P12 --> P13
    P8 --> P13
